<title>PHILIPPINES: Marsman 1996 net at 150.650 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Marsman 1996 net at 150.650 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical firm Marsman &amp; Co Inc said on Friday it posted a net income of 150.650 million pesos in 1996.</p>
<p>The company's statement did not give a year-ago figure but it has previously reported 1995 net profit at 97.67 million pesos.  </p>
<p>The company said total revenues in 1996 reached 13.020 billion pesos while expenses were at 12.785 billion.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
